SUMMARY:Live Music @ Fitz and the Wolfe
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nLet's check out some live music 
 at the trendy bar\, Fitz and the Wolfe!\n\nAt 8pm they'll have the Wrong W
 ay Trio\, showcasing 90s/2000s hits and country favorites\, all played “
 wrong” in reggae\, ska\, rock\, and punk styles.\n\nAt 9pm they'll have 
 Jazz at the speakeasy downstairs.
