SUMMARY:Drinks\, Discussion & The Odyssey
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nJoin us for a meetup to see Chri
 stopher Nolan’s The Odyssey. We’ll meet beforehand at Thirsty Monk in 
 Biltmore Park for a drink and conversation before heading to the theater t
 ogether.\n\nWhether you’re a fan of Nolan’s films\, interested in myth
 ology\, or simply enjoy discussing movies with others\, this is a chance t
 o experience one of the year’s most anticipated releases with fellow fil
 m enthusiasts.\n\nPlease note that tickets are not yet on sale and showtim
 es have not been announced. This event is being posted in advance so inter
 ested members can RSVP\, and the specific theater and movie time will be u
 pdated once those details become available.
